0644 => 100755 scripts/opencode-turns\n```\n\nThe transient `2b7ab03 Fallback opencode turns to SQLite on invalid export` content was reverted by `c3ab19c`; it is not present in the net source behavior. The attempt-4 commit `a1a3ca1` is included in the audited net range and adds external-provider transport timeout/account-unavailable rotation plus `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/age246_external_transport_rotation.rs`.\n\n## Isolated Command Gates\n\nFinal full workspace gates for `a1a3ca1` are rerun after auditor remediation and recorded by the coordinator before commit. The previous clean full-workspace gate for `1e043d3` is retained below only as historical continuity evidence.\n\n## Targeted Evidence Run\n\nTargeted log: `planning/s11-gate/evidence/targeted-tests.log`.\n\nTargeted status: `planning/s11-gate/evidence/targeted-tests.status` contains `targeted-tests status=0`.\n\nEnvironment recorded in the current targeted log:\n\n- `head=a1a3ca1` (`targeted-tests.log:3`)\n- `xdg=/tmp/s11-targeted-xdg.dSDiMU` (`targeted-tests.log:4`)\n- `target=/tmp/s11-targeted-build.UQPeFD/target` (`targeted-tests.log:5`)\n- `OULIPOLY_DATA_DIR=scrubbed` (`targeted-tests.log:6`)\n\nCurrent targeted commands covered:\n\n- `s11_external_provider_wake`: `8 passed` (`targeted-tests.log:373-385`)\n- `wu_b_mailbox_integration`: `20 passed` (`targeted-tests.log:391-415`)\n- `s10_external_provider_resume`: `2 passed` (`targeted-tests.log:421-427`)\n- `age217_s6a_policy_launch_dispatch`: `26 passed` (`targeted-tests.log:501-531`)\n- `age246_external_transport_rotation`: `3 passed` (`targeted-tests.log:537-544`)\n- `opencode-turns` shell suite: `opencode-turns tests passed` (`targeted-tests.log:547-548`)\n\n## Historical Full Workspace Gate\n\nFinal command log: `/tmp/s11-head-clean-verify-target-component.log`.\n\nEnvironment recorded in the log:\n\n- `head=1e043d3`\n- `xdg=/tmp/s11-head-clean-xdg.hu2qHi`\n- `target=/tmp/s11-head-clean-build.1jST5D/target`\n- `OULIPOLY_DATA_DIR=scrubbed`\n\nThe target directory intentionally contains a literal `target/` path component so `src-tauri/tests/workspace_layout.rs::binary_target_resolves` matches the workspace contract while avoiding stale shared-target binaries.\n\nCommand results:\n\n- `cargo fmt --check`: `fmt_status=0` (`/tmp/s11-head-clean-verify-target-component.log:9`)\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`: `clippy_status=0` (`/tmp/s11-head-clean-verify-target-component.log:389`)\n- `cargo test --workspace`: `test_status=0` (`/tmp/s11-head-clean-verify-target-component.log:5126`)\n\nKey suites observed in the clean workspace run:\n\n- `src-tauri/tests/s10_external_provider_resume.rs`: ran at `/tmp/s11-head-clean-verify-target-component.log:2367`, `2 passed` at line 2373.\n- `src-tauri/tests/s11_external_provider_wake.rs`: ran at line 2375, `8 passed` at line 2387.\n- `src-tauri/tests/wu_b_mailbox_integration.rs`: ran at line 2526, `20 passed` at line 2550.\n- `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/age217_s6a_policy_launch_dispatch.rs`: ran at line 3778, `26 passed` at line 3808.\n- `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/age243_s7a_session_dispatch.rs::opencode_read_turns_ingests_normalized_jsonl`: `ok` at line 3973 after the executable-bit remediation.\n\nS11-specific tests observed in the clean run:\n\n- `external_provider_wake_does_not_mark_delivered_when_resume_produces_no_turn`: `ok` at line 2381.\n- `external_provider_wake_confirms_delivery_from_submitted_turn_marker`: `ok` at line 2382.\n- `external_provider_failed_wake_releases_claim_and_retries_pending_mailbox`: `ok` at line 2384.\n- `external_provider_rate_limited_wake_records_error_and_retries_pending_mailbox`: `ok` at line 2385.\n\n## Live Runtime Evidence\n\nSee `planning/s11-gate/evidence/live-smoke.md` for inspected live file paths and contents.\n\nKey live artifacts:\n\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/initial10.log` contains `DISPATCHED ab_19e9eb3c740_11963_58a0b4405542b714` and successful initial `OULIPOLY_RESULT`.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh10-notify2.stdout` contains wake `attempted: true`, `status: spawned`, `wake_pid: 2188`, and `auto_wake_count: 1`.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh10-opencode-argv.log` contains resumed `[OULIPOLY NOTIFICATIONS]` prompts with `rc: 0` entries.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh10-xdg-data/oulipoly-agent-runner/pid-identity.db` mailbox rows for seq 1 and 2 were read via Python SQLite as `CONFIRMED-DELIVERED`, `delivery_attempts=1`, no delivery error, and `delivered_by_invocation_uuid='7a46a1a5-844d-45e8-bd67-aecaf9cf9194'`.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh10-xdg-data/oulipoly-agent-runner/invocations/7a46a1a5-844d-45e8-bd67-aecaf9cf9194.result` contains `\"status\":\"succeeded\"` and `\"success\":true`.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh13-export.json` contains exported session text `WOKE 0`.\n- `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh10-workload-done.txt` and `/tmp/s11-e2e/fresh13-workload-done.txt` contain `S11-WAKE-OK`.\n- `/tmp/s10-e2e/final.log` and `/tmp/s10-e2e/final2.log` contain `S10-EXTERNAL-OK` and successful final `OULIPOLY_RESULT`.\n- Local retained `/tmp/s10-e2e` files did not contain `S10-FINAL-OK` or `S10-RESUME-OK` during this refresh; S10 resume remains bound to shipped deterministic integration tests.\n- `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-nes-projects-agent-runner/45ccb26a-8bb6-4486-9b1e-2226e29292a0/tasks/bvnh4nja0.output` contains `XHIGH-EXTERNAL-OK` and `\"status\":\"succeeded\"`.\n\n## Schema Boundary\n\nNo `state.db` schema migration is declared or required. The S11 touched list does not include `crates/oulipoly-state/src/schema.rs`, `crates/oulipoly-state/src/migrations.rs`, or migration SQL. New delivery-attempt state is sidecar mailbox state.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":112,"totalLines":112,"truncated":false}},"title":"../../home/nes/projects/agent-runner/worktrees/age-pid-sidecar/planning/s11-gate/evidence/runtime-tests.log","time":{"start":1780800680499,"end":1780800680523}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d439f4d065c2cd6016a24dca8512c8190b503570525616866"}},"id":"prt_e9ffdf22f001Sq9rVMTnTJU26I","sessionID":"ses_160025a55